		"grep/find/whole-file reads, read .entire/graph-agent.md — resolution-first guidance\n" +
		"for using graph retrieval, focused source inspection, and verification.\n" +
		"@.entire/graph-agent.md\n" +
		agentPointerEnd + "\n"

